      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِعْرَقٌ</span></b>  <i>An iron implement,</i> or <i>a knife,</i> or <i>broad
knife,</i> or <i>broad blade, with which one pares a bone
with some flesh upon it, removing the flesh.</i> (TA.) ＝ 
 
